# Hosts that reject requests coming from data-centre IP ranges. Both open fine
# in a browser, so a CI failure here would only ever be a false positive.
^https://www\.npmjs\.com/
^https://stackoverflow\.com/

# Answers 403 "Access Denied" to GitHub runners (issue 379, run 42020895190), and
# to curl and a headless browser on a data-centre host, for its home page as well.
# Whether the alert itself still opens elsewhere could not be checked from there.
^https://www\.cisa\.gov/
